# Shared API (`apps/web/src/shared/api`)

- Configure the oRPC client and TanStack Query utils in `shared/api/orpc.ts`.
- Import from `@/shared/api/orpc` — never duplicate client setup in features or views.

```ts
import { orpc } from "@/shared/api/orpc";

const healthCheck = useQuery(orpc.healthCheck.queryOptions());
```

- Feature-specific query wrappers (if needed) live under `features/<domain>/lib/`, not in `shared/api`.
- Do not call `fetch` directly for app API calls; use the oRPC client.
